{"version":1,"content":"<html>\n<body><p>更新時間：07:31 2026-07-24 HKT<br/>發佈時間：07:31 2026-07-24 HKT</p>\n<p>發佈時間：07:31 2026-07-24 HKT</p><p>各大聯賽積極備戰新一季，轉會市場亦非常活躍。阿仙奴宣布以3400萬鎊收購翼鋒佐利斯，阿士東維拉亦正式宣布借用加拿祖一季。艾利諾安達臣亦完成轉會曼城的手續，他透露偶像是曾效力「藍月」的迪布尼。意甲方面，40歲的莫迪歷與AC米蘭續約1年。</p><p>至於意大利足總希望在今周內公布新帥人選，而技術總監馬甸尼證實曾經接觸哥迪奧拿和安察洛堤。</p><img alt=\"佐利斯去季助布魯日贏得比甲冠軍。法新社\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/b97b9cbf86cc598c390674e1aeac2c0f/2026-07/AFP__20260524__174950890__v1__HighRes__SoccerJplCpoD10ClubBruggeVsKaaGent.jpg\"/><img alt=\"加拿祖從車路士外借維拉。維拉IG\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/d47ac033cf855f641901e26e8b7b5e0a/2026-07/Sealed_with_a_selfie_.jpg\"/><img alt=\"安達臣透露迪布尼是他的偶像。法新社\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/0af5bcdd66e364de9686d6270180f05b/2026-07/AFP__20250309__DPPI_40225119_020__v1__HighRes__FootballEnglishChampNottinghamVManche.jpg\"/><img alt=\"莫迪歷與AC米蘭續約1季。法新社\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/11c62e6f286b83c965aca1a16ebcd0f2/2026-07/AFP__20260309__ballabio-acmilana260308_npEJd__v1__HighRes__AcMilanVFcInternazionaleS.jpg\"/><img alt=\"馬甸尼承認曾經接觸哥迪奧拿和安察洛堤。法新社\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/ad7f5d8d8d8e1473c14302d393319410/2026-07/AFP__20260723__decarli-notitle260723_npK7p__v1__HighRes__PressConferenceAtTheSerieAF.jpg\"/><p>最Hit</p>\n</body>\n</html>","scraped_at":"2026-07-23T23:38:42.288331+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":245,"images":5,"source":"星島頭條","fallback":"none"}}